    "detailed_description": "Description<br />\r\nYou find yourself in a big empty house. Around the Christmas lights, but no friends, no family.<br />\r\nYou are alone. What for?<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u00a0Zombie Claus is a game in which everything is not as it seems. The main character behaved badly all year, for which a bad Santa wants to punish him.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features:<br />\r\n\u2022 Immerse yourself in the atmosphere of Christmas horror. If you're looking for something to play during the holidays, Zombie Claus is the perfect choice.<br />\r\n\u2022 Feel lonely. Only you and the evil Santa are in the house. And soon he will catch you.<br />\r\n\u2022 Puzzles - solve puzzles to access areas, collect and use objects found in the environment.<br />\r\n\u2022 Explore dark and disturbing rooms for answers.<br />\r\n\u2022 High-quality voice acting.",
